---
description: Wait for CI and resolve review comments before calling a PR done
alwaysApply: true
---

After every push on a pull request, wait for GitHub checks. Read review comments from people and bots (Bugbot, Copilot, and the rest). Fix failures and outstanding feedback, push, and repeat.

Green CI includes the new or updated tests for the change.

You are not done until checks are green and review issues are resolved, or the user explicitly defers them.
